  "adaptations": [
    "Moved copied source under src aliases",
    "Replace glyph adapter with Lucide",
    "ALEConnect typography/token/padding roles",
    "Static installed KeyboardProvider for stable native ownership",
    "Equal centered 48px field decorators",
    "Compact tab visuals with nonoverlapping expanded hit areas",
    "Select content presentation reuses options in an existing sheet; BottomSheet.Content.onBack returns within that sheet on Android. Reports and Appearance replace content and preserve their parent state.",
    "Inter 400/500/600/700 native font utility aliases; Text and Input preserve caller typography without forced inline faces. Jakarta 600/700 is reserved for prominent headings.",
    "BottomSheet.Footer owns 12px top margin and 12px top padding around its semantic separator; optional native sheet root has no extra child gap. All action footers inherit this spacing.",
    "Carousel pan freezes its touch-down position and cancels the previous spring; cumulative movement events use that origin so one swipe advances one slide. Home reuses full-width Carousel and 24px slide gaps without indicators inside 16px gutters.",
    "ProgressButton uses fresh continuous hold attempts, real-time three-second emergency duration, release/background/route/unmount cancellation and fixture dial suppression. Latest reviewed upstream source0.108.0 merged without overwriting existing adaptations.",
